@* The Art.  This group of sections defines data structures for the graphic art
and includes the .h files that define the art.

@ This structure defines an art set for a path or node.

@<Typedef...@>=
typedef struct art_t {
  short *palette;
  unsigned long *data;
}ArtSet, *ArtSetPtr;

@ Here are a bunch of structures that tell us where our art is.

@<Global...@>=
ArtSet round1PathArt = {
  round1PathPalette,
  round1CellData
};

